# 画面印刷 (design 11.24), for tools/ui_run.py: a rectangle dragged out with
# the loupe beside the pointer, taken into the tray at PrintScreen, and the
# picture pasted into a text. The panel (536x284 in the middle of a
# 1280x800 screen; a part at l,t of the panel at 380+l,266+t): トレーへ複写,
# 範囲指定, PrntScrnキーで実行. While the rectangle is picked the loupe
# shows the pixels round the pointer six times as large, below and right
# of it, above and left of it near the screen's corner; it goes once the
# rectangle is let go. The picture pasted into the text TADjsについて is
# written beside the text's record and stands in it as a figure.
open 01a0d8c4-53d0-7a21-8b32-4c5d6e7f53d0
expect scrprint: panel 1
wait 600
click 414 339
click 650 395
click 414 455
wait 150
shot loupe_panel
click 836 511
expect scrprint: pick 1
expect scrprint: loupe on
move 300 260
wait 400
shot loupe_hover
down
move 420 330
move 560 420
wait 400
shot loupe_drag
move 1240 770
wait 400
shot loupe_corner
move 560 420
wait 200
up
expect scrprint: loupe off
expect scrprint: range 1 300 260 561 421
expect scrprint: armed 1: 1 0 2 1
wait 300
shot loupe_gone
key 46
expect scrprint: taken 1 300 260 561 421
expect scrprint: tray 1
wait 600
# the tray's picture pasted into a text: beside its record, a figure in it
open 019a6c96-e262-7dfd-a3bc-1e85d495d60d
wait 2000
win TADjsについて
shot loupe_doc
key 19 01
expect tray: picture
wait 800
shot loupe_doc_pasted
# nothing it did was refused for want of a right
absent !OACV!
